    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Bomb Caterpillar's Big Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;\u00d6oo&quot;</strong> is a charming yet mysterious exploration puzzle platformer where you discover creative ways to use bombs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Variety of Solutions Using Bombs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/13c4f47e6c918c73516b6ba281619dbd.poster.avif?t=1754578827\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/13c4f47e6c918c73516b6ba281619dbd.webm?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/13c4f47e6c918c73516b6ba281619dbd.mp4?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover unique ways to use bombs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/31ce55e40560b967d5e1ee100855c2c5.poster.avif?t=1754578827\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/31ce55e40560b967d5e1ee100855c2c5.webm?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/31ce55e40560b967d5e1ee100855c2c5.mp4?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover hidden paths with clever bomb usage!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/9ea39531c407af689e2eb4ba245c3b48.poster.avif?t=1754578827\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/9ea39531c407af689e2eb4ba245c3b48.webm?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/9ea39531c407af689e2eb4ba245c3b48.mp4?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse the map to find hidden routes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/64937cb6f4e22e8d85e003ae5e2a0345.poster.avif?t=1754578827\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/64937cb6f4e22e8d85e003ae5e2a0345.webm?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721890/extras/64937cb6f4e22e8d85e003ae5e2a0345.mp4?t=1754578827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dense experience that can be enjoyed in just <strong>2\u20133 hours</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>cute yet oddly mysterious</strong> world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse puzzle solutions that change depending on how you use bombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No text</strong> \u2014 enjoy the game without language barriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute enough to delight even those who don\u2019t like bugs!</p></li></ul>",
